  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sponsored walk to help tackle food poverty in UK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">President Peter Bradley, of the Rotary Club of Edgware and Stanmore, will be doing a virtual sponsored walk at the end of April 2022 from one end of the UK to the other, Lands End to John&apos;O&apos;Groats, to raise money for My Yard and awareness of food poverty in the United Kingdom. His progress can be followed via the app Conqueror in real time on Google Earth. The charity &quot;My Yard&quot; not only provides food to those in need it takes into account dietary requirements and teaches people to cook healthily</narrative>
  </description>
